{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06596","headline":"次天元十载华阴发兵作时有郎官点发 · 储光羲","name":"次天元十载华阴发兵作时有郎官点发","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"鬼方生猃狁，时寇卢龙营。\n帝念霍嫖姚，诏发咸林兵。\n天星下文阁，简师临我城。\n三陌观勇夫，五饵谋长缨。\n雷野大车发，震云灵鼓鸣。\n太华色莽苍，清渭风交横。\n胡马悲雨雪，诗人歌斾旌。\n阏氏爲女奴，单于作边氓。\n神皇麒麟阁，大将不书名。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"储光羲","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06596.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06596","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}